1. Place this repo somewhere local (e.g. `~/.dsh/profiles/web/plugins/dsh-api-balance/`)
2. Edit `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json`:

```jsonc
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@Badegg404/dsh-api-balance": "file:plugins/dsh-api-balance"
  },

3. `pnpm install`, then restart DSH.

